      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِفَاحٌ</span></b> , which is disapproved in horses, is [<i>A
quality</i>] <i>like what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْحَة</span> [app. meaning
<i>a flatness,</i> or <i>an evenness,</i>] <i>in the side</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْض</span>) <i>of</i>

<i>the cheek, by reason of which its width is excessive.</i>
(O, K.) ＝   
